ition does is highlight all variables of the one your cursor is on like in this example:\r\n<img width=\"441\" height=\"129\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/df127365-e7a6-4849-aa0a-ea96f37ce96c\" />\r\n\r\nFor people who want to test this in NeoVim and haven't highlighting enabled:\r\n`:lua vim.api.nvim_create_autocmd({\"CursorHold\",\"CursorHoldI\"},{buffer=0,callback=vim.lsp.buf.document_highlight}); vim.api.nvim_create_autocmd(\"CursorMoved\",{buffer=0,callback=vim.lsp.buf.clear_references}); vim.opt.updatetime=200`\r\n\r\nIt's another small addition to the language server, but one which some people might want as it could be useful in certain situations.","labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098082,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgwODI=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:gdscript","name":"topic:gdscript","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098219,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgyMTk=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:editor","name":"topic:editor","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":14236899,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4A2Tzj","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/24","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/24","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/24/labels","number":24,"state":"closed","title":"4.7","description":"","creator":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/